      6e3eac3d6caaf06f t("390 list row: notes",Inter,15,sb,align(l),lh(1.4)) p(0,0) s(fill,hug:21) ext(440,) f[(e4c45ceefcb6b70a,#ECECEC)] "Text 645"
      96fa3849d18c8f3f t("• Prod today: the code chip and the time take the row, titles are cut at about 18 characters.",Inter,12,r,align(l),lh(1.4)) p(0,29) s(420,hug:33.6) f[(de36993838111eec,#9A9A9F)] "Text 646"
      9d6d389de32ea0df t("• Proposed (both options A and B): the title gets the row and wraps to two lines; the time stays rightmost on line 1 (OR-64); line 2 is the agent mark and the newest line. The code is not shown on the phone; it stays in the session head and in search.",Inter,12,r,align(l),lh(1.4)) p(0,70.6) s(420,hug:67.2) f[(7a9af772045ca5a2,#9A9A9F)] "Text 647"
      f04d747d0fcfd3f5 t("• Missing mark on C-CXX-835 is a data gap, not a missing agent: the session ran codex, but the list takes the harness of the newest execution of any kind, and its newest is a run without a harness. Fix: take the newest agent run (a one-line query change, no visible design change).",Inter,12,r,align(l),lh(1.4)) p(0,145.8) s(420,hug:67.2) f[(87d9b5155ae88ba5,#9A9A9F)] "Text 648"
      85457090cda59f49 t("• The bot rows and their threads (option B) use the same two-line row.",Inter,12,r,align(l),lh(1.4)) p(0,221) s(420,hug:16.8) f[(4bea254a2ff98d4a,#9A9A9F)] "Text 649"
